Rule 5 (if input tensor has 0 elements, output should have 0 elements)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_2.len > 0 then (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) = (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = 0)
